ION</span></div><h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight mb-space-sm">Engaging AI Buyers Through the Channel</h2><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Enterprise AI buyers don't respond to broad claims or generic vendor whitepapers. They evaluate AI based on specific industry use cases, verifiable time-to-value, and de-risked implementation paths. We help vendors and distributors build through-channel campaign engines that partners can deploy locally.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md mb-space-md"><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl border border-mist-border flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-md shadow-sm"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold" style="background-color: #F7F4EE; color: #10263F;"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">calculate</span></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="background-color: #F7F4EE; color: #10263F; border: 1px solid #DCE6E8;">Turnkey Validation</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Proof-of-Value Campaigns</h3><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Turnkey, co-branded campaign packages that move buyers from curiosity to trial. Structured around interactive value calculators, pilot qualification scorecards, and lightweight validation sprints that partners can execute with clear attribution.</p></div><div class="pt-space-xs border-t border-mist-border flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-sm text-label-sm" style="color: #10263F;"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="color: #C7A46A;">check_circle</span><span>Accelerates enterprise qualification &amp; partner co-selling</span></div></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-