<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-xl"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter"><div class="max-w-3xl mb-space-lg"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs mb-space-xs"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style="background-color: #C7A46A;"></span><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold" style="color: #10263F;">COMMERCIAL IMPACT &amp; LEAD GOVERNANCE</span></div><h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight mb-space-sm">Create Demand That Your Partners Can Convert Into Opportunity.</h2><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Through-channel demand generation should do more than increase campaign activity. It should strengthen the connection between marketing investment, partner engagement and customer acquisition through transparent governance.</p></div><!-- VENDOR-TO-PARTNER LEAD GOVERNANCE SWIMLANES --><div class="space-y-space-md mb-space-lg"><!-- Swimlane 1: Traditional Path --><div class="bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl border border-mist-border"><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-space-xs border-b border-mist-border mb-space-sm"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="w-2 h-2 bg-error rounded-full"></span><span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Traditional Fragmented Channel Path</span></div><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow text-error uppercase tracking-wider">High Friction &amp; Lost Attribution</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-space-sm"><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded-lg border border-mist-border/40 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-80"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Step 1: Ingestion</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold">Unvetted Portal Dump</span><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Vendor pushes raw, unvalidated form fills into static partner portal queues without qualification.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-error mt-space-xs">Zero Lead Scrubbing</span></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded-lg border border-mist-border/40 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-80"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Step 2: Distribution</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold">Uncoordinated Routing</span><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Contacts assigned randomly or broadcast to all partner reps, sparking conflicts and spam complaints.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-error mt-space-xs">Channel Friction</span></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded-lg border border-mist-border/40 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-80"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Step 3: Execution</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold">Neglected Follow-Up</span><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No response SLAs enforced; partners deprioritize cold inquiries to focus on competing product lines.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-error mt-space-xs">Decayed Pipeline</span></div><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded-lg border border-mist-border/40 flex flex-col justify-between opacity-80"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Step 4: Tracking</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-semibold">Attribution Black Hole</span><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Zero CRM data loopback to central vendor marketing; co-op ROI cannot be validated or refined.</p></div><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-error mt-space-xs">Wasted Co-Op Capital</span></div></div></div><!-- Swimlane 2: MBM Governed Pipeline with 6 Embedded Outcomes --><div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-md rounded-xl border-2 shadow-lg" style="border-color: rgb(16, 38, 63);"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between pb-space-xs border-b border-mist-border mb-space-sm gap-space-xs"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style="background-color: #C7A46A;"></span><span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary font-bold">MBM Governed Through-Channel Pipeline</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">End-to-end telemetry connecting verified customer demand directly with partner closing capacity.</p></div><span class="px-space-sm py-1 font-label-sm text-label-sm rounded uppercase tracking-wider font-bold self-start md:self-auto shadow-sm" style="background-color: #C7A46A; color: #10263F;">SLA-Governed Architecture</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-space-sm"><!-- Stage 1: Demand Capture --><div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between border border-mist-border"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-wider font-bold" style="color: #10263F;">Stage 01</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="color: #10263F;">public</span></div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Vendor Demand Capture</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Precision multi-channel campaigns acquire enterprise buying group interest with verified account intent.</p></div><div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs border-t border-mist-border flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs" style="color: #10263F;"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="color: #C7A46A;">public</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-primary">Greater Market Reach</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Penetrate adjacent verticals, underserved geographies and specialized customer cohorts through established partner footprints.</p></div></div><!-- Stage 2: Verified Routing --><div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between border border-mist-border"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-wider font-bold" style="color: #10263F;">Stage 02</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="color: #10263F;">verified</span></div><h4 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Verified Routing</h4><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Scrubbed and enriched leads matched to certified regional partners with immediate notification.</p></div><div class="mt-space-md pt-space-xs border-t border-mist-border flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs" style="color: #10263F;"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="color: #C7A46A;">verified</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-primary">Improved Lead Quality</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Filter noise at the source and enforce shared service level agreements for timely, accountable channel sales follow-up.</p></div></div><!-- Stage 3: Partner Sales SLA Follow-up --><div class="bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between border border-mist-border"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-eyebrow text-eyebrow uppercase tracking-wider font-bold" style="color: #10263F;">Stage 03</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm