-slate-300">Track multi-touch attribution from initial partner co-op deployment to closed-won revenue in your channel pipeline ledger.</p></div></div></div><!-- Complementary Impact Metrics Banner --><div class="mt-space-sm pt-space-sm border-t border-mist-border grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md"><div class="flex items-start gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base mt-0.5" style="color: #3156A3;">how_to_reg</span><div><span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-primary">Stronger Participation:</span><span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant ml-1">Increase active co-marketing adoption across partner tiers by reducing execution complexity and offering ready-to-run campaigns.</span></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-space-xs"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base mt-0.5" style="color: #3156A3;">mark_email_read</span><div><span class="font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-primary">Relevant Engagement:</span><span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant ml-1">Deliver localized, context-aware messaging that speaks directly to regional end-user problems rather than broad generic corporate rhetoric.</span></div></div></div></div></div><!-- Strategy Takeaway Banner --><div class="p-space-md bg-surface-container rounded-lg flex items-center gap-space-sm border border-mist-border"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-2xl flex-shrink-0">flag</span><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-primary"><strong>The Core Objective:</strong> The objective is not simply to generate more leads. It is to create qualified demand that partners are equipped and motivated to pursue.</p></div></div></section>
